defect.detail:
The module-level textLength() (:509-514) is used directly by reflowText (:541, :602);
      the class method wrapper at :166-168 is never invoked — grep for `\.textLength\(` across src/
      returns no matches. Leftover upstream API surface.

defect.summary:
Four ConversationManager helpers — addAssistantMessage (:51), addToolUseMessage (:55),
      addAssistantMessageWithTools (:68), addToolResultMessage (:85) — have zero production callers;
      only tests reference them.
